Original role-prompt strings and synthesized style guides are included with
source hashes. Fresh native contexts or the original role classes backed by official SDK
calls provide isolated inference. The orchestration restores reference-driven multimodal planning,
separate role inputs, full-description regeneration, and three critic rounds.
Native artifact storage, strict critic validation, context batching, preserved
meaningful legends, and an explicitly requested SVG renderer are adaptations
described in FIDELITY.md. No original benchmark score is claimed.

Reference metadata and selected images are fetched at use from the original
author's public PaperBanana Space. The reference corpus is not bundled or
relicensed; underlying paper figures retain their source provenance.

